{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f612fc9e9b8e2c14de4d54428234d9ce3218013ab825e79fcdeb74b60201c649",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aca66b527daea0b0c90cbde2cf82e578f28a24de41df5e1dfa62e8523703b957",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●●●●●●●监督。\n现在稍微方便聊两句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf4fc3431b71c51f362a6856c0825ddb34b38d6e59a414e9e880677dde34d71",
      "text": "其实我刚才在看上次直播的\n录播回放呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37f6a8d1c9270bece1e424f2cc35ace7c092ef710ab05ad49997c343039751b3",
      "text": "想确认一下大家的评论嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6642a07e63eff02baf820119a16f8b570ed30db9d1edec58ad3707232f21aa6",
      "text": "特别是打枕头仗的时候，\n根本没法仔细看对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b397b06666d851bc3382da4c84c924a64bee2077ca25b499f23053aa196f86e3",
      "text": "结果啊，我看到好多评论说还想看这种直播……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2100ff89124342d098a654aea39bff7b037212279c791f159becc1f22d9f361a",
      "text": "高兴起来，就给监督打电话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65963b4a1e24be46f610190cd284dfd026ffc5441f8caaf8b0d5276b27075b6f",
      "text": "下次再办吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5db1b0efc6ac15b474c32f32102f0ad1a989b3ec9ca7d91351b2b71d0eb943e0",
      "text": "下次想做\n些什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d975f3a5e0093af531a5ea045c87a4f661086ff6e4700bd9c30abe922343c0db",
      "text": "嗯。明明聊了那么多玩了那么多，\n时间还是完全不够用呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d08c59a9cc1713a1bf5bf00bed5d01e21bbbd08c6ed95a3284f13145e5a68d79",
      "text": "尝试新事物也很有趣，不过还想再玩枕头仗、\n开零食派对啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d741a2b0be46570762a4fdbf3f30e79ab513f0a7119f58d6c74501847e7d4de",
      "text": "要是能和大家办睡衣派对第二弹，\n光是那样肯定就超级开心了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9c1aa3c5e11ddcad21a198df9957341d6da8331ef191dfe5ecaf90ad29a411",
      "text": "直播时，桐生虽然也响应要求做了模仿表演\n就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acc9b8400720a90ba0772a17f70f6b5a384ffc6906917a8f1461b53943833410",
      "text": "像这样看到大家的感想，就跃跃欲试地想让大家\n更加开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:013kys_402_2_4_013_02_09_a:2_4_013_02_09_a:cmd-000039:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53a0fe7766a8dd3fc1cc3c52a6c3cbcb2e82f0356e177b48a63f2e69893c68ea",
      "text": "为了今后也能给大家带来更多快乐，\n下一份工作我也会加油的。那就明天见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
